# Repo-wide ignores.
#
# These live at the root deliberately. infra/terraform-aws/ has its own .gitignore and
# stayed clean; infra/terraform-azure/ had none, and `terraform init` there put 580 MB of
# provider binaries into a commit — one of them 215 MB, past GitHub's hard 100 MB limit,
# which rejected the push. A per-directory ignore only protects the directories someone
# remembered to write one for, so the artifact patterns belong here where every current
# and future infra directory inherits them.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Terraform
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Provider binaries and module cache. Regenerated by `terraform init`, hundreds of MB,
# and platform-specific — a darwin_arm64 provider is useless to anyone on linux_amd64.
.terraform/

# State. Plaintext secrets, and it belongs in the remote backend rather than in git.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*

# Real variable values. Only the .example files are committed.
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars

# Plan output — can contain resolved secret values.
*.tfplan

crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

build/
*.zip

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Example run artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# e2e-agent writes the full prompt, response, and user id into every audit entry and one
# provenance file per request. Both are produced by running the demo, and both are exactly
# the kind of content that should never reach a commit. The Terraform patterns above guard
# against a 580 MB push; these guard against a smaller and more embarrassing one.
examples/e2e-agent/audit.log
examples/e2e-agent/provenance/

# rag-* build a local index on first run.
examples/rag-faiss/index.faiss
examples/rag-langchain/index.faiss

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

.DS_Store
